<!--
    Recipe: record
    Every value the robot has that can change from one tick to the next (2026-11-26, for recording training data:
    TODO/p4_recording_plan.md). The gains loaded into the drives (m_KPP .. g_vel_lim) are left out: they change only
    when set, and a recorder saves them once per recording. Meant for the binary format (set_telemetry_format), where
    every value is exact and the whole packet costs the robot ~4 us a tick; as text it costs ~0.3 ms a tick.
-->
